ement\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Watch_51407a.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></td><td>Watch</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">20 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Gold\"><img alt=\"Gold\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Worm\"><img alt=\"Worm\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Worm_9999f6.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></td><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Worm\">Worm</a></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">1 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Gold\"><img alt=\"Gold\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"item-notes\"><b>Notes:</b><ol><li id=\"w-notes-1\">By saying <i>(sell/buy) item name</i>.</li></ol></div></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-transcripts\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Transcripts\">Transcripts</span></h3>\n<dl><dd><i>To change these transcripts, edit the transcripts page for Zora.</i></dd></dl>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\n<b> <i>Player:</i> Hi</b><br/>\nZora: Ah, look what the north wind blew here. Hope you're up to some business.<br/>\n<b> <i>Player:</i> job</b><br/>\nZora: I am overseeing some of our operations here.<br/>\n<b> <i>Player:</i> name<br/></b>\nZora: I am known as Zora and just for your information, there is no longer a bounty on my head.<br/>\n<b> <i>Player:</i> bounty</b><br/>\nZora: I was ... kind of wild in my youth.<br/>\n<b> <i>Player:</i> trade</b><br/>\nZora: About time someone is interested in my wares. Footballs have to be purchased separately.<br/>\n<b> <i>Player:</i> equipment</b><br/>\nZora: If you'd like to see my offers, ask me for a trade.<br/>\n<b> <i>Player:</i> Venore</b><br/>\nZora: Venore will recognise my efforts here and I am sure I'll get a promotion soon.<br/>\n<b> <i>Player:</i> Carlin</b><br/>\nZora: Carlin is a thorn in our side. A little one but a thorn nonetheless.<br/>\n<b> <i>Player:</i> Svargrond</b><br/>\nZora: If I had more ships and men, I'd take over that town in one surprise attack. But the way things are now, this would be a waste of resources. Well, our base here is sufficient for now.<br/>\n<b> <i>Player:</i> mines</b><br/>\nZora: The mines are still a problem. Those raiders make it impossible to do something about the mines.<br/>\n<b> <i>Player:</i> raiders</b><br/>\nZora: They somewhat remind me of the men I sailed with in my youth. Still they are enemies and I ordered our men to kill them on sight.<br/>\n<b> <i>Player:</i> barbarians</b><br/>\nZora: It's a sad thing that our people are split. With each year that is passing, we drift further apart from each other.<br/>\n<b> <i>Player:</i> Ferumbras</b><br/>\nZora: He is more a problem in the South.<br/>\n<b> <i>Player:</i> excalibug</b><br/>\nZora: Looking for that weapon seems quite unprofitable.<br/>\n<b> <i>Player:</i> bye</b><br/>\nZora: Come back when you're up to some business, <b> <i>player</i>.</b>\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Zora</strong></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>","quests":[],"pos":{"x":32362,"y":31324,"z":6}}